@host = http://localhost:5080
@adminKey = dev-admin-key-change-me

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Forward a configured GET operation (demo seed: echo.get -> https://httpbin.org/anything/{resourceId})
POST {{host}}/api/proxy/execute
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-0001
X-Tenant-Id: tenant-42

{
  "clientId": "echo.get",
  "json": { "urlId": "httpbin", "resourceId": "abc-123", "verbose": true }
}

### Forward a configured POST operation with body parameters
POST {{host}}/api/proxy/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "echo.post",
  "idempotencyKey": "order-7781",
  "json": { "urlId": "httpbin", "customerId": "0f8fad5b-d9cb-469f-a165-70867728950e", "amount": 99.5, "note": "first order" }
}

### Rejected: unknown operation (404, never forwarded)
POST {{host}}/api/proxy/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "does.not.exist", "json": { "urlId": "httpbin" } }

### Rejected: caller tries to override the destination (400 envelope.unknown_member)
POST {{host}}/api/proxy/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "echo.get", "destinationUrl": "https://evil.example/", "json": { "urlId": "httpbin", "resourceId": "x" } }

### Rejected: path traversal attempt (400 parameters.invalid)
POST {{host}}/api/proxy/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "echo.get", "json": { "urlId": "httpbin", "resourceId": "../admin" } }

### Admin: list operations
GET {{host}}/api/admin/operations
X-Admin-ApiKey: {{adminKey}}

### Admin: disable an operation (replace the stamp with the ETag from the GET above)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/operations/echo.get
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-ApiKey: {{adminKey}}
If-Match: "REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_STAMP"

{ "isEnabled": false }

### Admin: configuration history
GET {{host}}/api/admin/configuration-changes?entityType=Operation&take=20
X-Admin-ApiKey: {{adminKey}}
